# The built script, stylesheet and fonts have a hash of their content in their
# names: a changed file is a new name. A browser that has one need not ask
# again whether it is still good, which without this it does on every visit.
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

# Every page and file: a browser does not guess a type other than the one it
# is told, and a link followed to another site says only where it came from,
# not which page (SEC-007). Whether the pages may be framed, and a content
# security policy, are not set here: see the security audit.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
